    {
      "content": "So on the next day first thing in the morning, we will unload everything in your new home. We have estimated the unloading to take about at three and a half hours with the same four movers and two truck. So for your moving on Saturday, 44 movers that will cost $420 per hour and for year and load on Sunday that's $404 per hour.",
